WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
(dramatic music playing)

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.254
Go ahead, just tell us.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:05.255
♪

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:06.632
I killed her.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.175
♪

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.053
- Daniel Hegarty.
- June Lenker.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.429
Thanks for seeing me.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:13.722
♪

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.432
I'm investigating a phone call.

00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:16.767
(phone ringing)

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.269
- dispatch: Police.
- woman: Listen, he's gonna kill me.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.313
How can I help?

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.773
They made an allegation.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.233
It was an old case that you worked.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.903
woman: A long time ago,
my boyfriend, he stabbed her.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.029
(busy signal)

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.698
You are aware that he confessed?

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:34.201
June: What if he's innocent?

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:35.118
♪

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:37.329
That case was investigated fairly.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:39.206
(tense music playing)

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.292
- What is he hiding?
- Let it go.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.294
Danny's one of the good ones.

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:47.005
♪

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:49.299
Daniel: There are things
that nobody teaches you.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.885
Sometimes you have to go the extra mile.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:53.387
There's no shame in that.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.139
- We got our man.
- No, you got a confession.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.893
- Daniel: We need to cover our backs.
- She's got it in for us.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:02.896
June: I think he wants to fight.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:03.939
I can do that.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.984
That's the game. Collateral damage.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.402
♪

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:11.405
Daniel: Do you know the difference
between order and chaos?

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:12.406
♪

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.365
Are you gonna stop me?

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.450
♪

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:17.035
(screaming)

00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:17.953
♪

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.207
Yeah.

